onnxruntime-gpu-bin provides CMake targets:

    find_package(onnxruntime-gpu-bin CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE onnxruntime::onnxruntime)

Copy ${ONNXRUNTIME_RUNTIME_DLLS} next to your executable (the CUDA provider DLL is loaded at
runtime). The CUDA 12.8+ / cuDNN 9 runtime DLLs must be on PATH for the CUDA execution provider.
